OL,3,GNEWSA'End of an era' for Skirlington
OL,4,AMarket
OL,5,
OL,6,FTraders have told of their sadness as a
OL,7,Fmarket vacates its 40-year-old site.
OL,9,FSkirlington Market, in Skipsea, East
OL,10,FYorkshire, is moving to a field on the
OL,11,Froad to Bridlington.
OL,13,FIn July, Unity Holidays was granted
OL,14,Fapproval to build sports facilities on
OL,15,Fthe current site.
OL,17,FThe market closed on Sunday, but is
OL,18,Fexpected to reopen at its new home in
OL,19,Fspring.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
